# package-lock.json is the lockfile: CI and the production image both run
# `npm ci`, so a second lockfile from another package manager is a second
# source of truth that can disagree with it silently. Delete this line if the
# project ever actually moves to bun — and move CI and the Dockerfile with it.
bun.lock

